{"articleNo":"2383","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2383&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"재학생 설문조사 실시 안내(성적열람 및 정정기간)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.12.07","hit":"16643","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕 Bold&quot;\">재학생 설문조사 실시 안내</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕 Bold&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">공학교육인증제도에 대한 재학생 설문조사를 통해 공학교육 개선안을 도출하고자</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;\"> 아래와 같이 재학생 대상 온라인 설문조사를 실시하고자 하오니, 학생들의 적극적인 참여 바랍니다.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;\">� 온라인 설문조사 기간</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;\">&nbsp;∘ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;\">2009. 12. 29(화) ~ 12. 31(목) 성적열람 및 정정 기간</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;\">� 설문조사 대상</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;\">&nbsp;∘ 재학생 전체(나노바이오텍스타일, 산업경영학과 제외)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;\">&nbsp;∘ 인증/비인증과정 전체 실시</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;\">� 설문조사 방법</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;\">&nbsp;∘ 학생이 2009-2학기 성적 열람 전 온라인 설문 실시</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#000000\"> </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\">(학생이 온라인으로 설문조사를 종료해야만 성적 열람 가능)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;\">� </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">설문조사 경로&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;∘ 원스톱서비스 → 로그인 → 수업(학생) → 수강신청 및 금학기성적내역</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">설문조사를 완료하여야 성적 열람이 가능</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">하오니, 학생 여러분의 양해 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">공 학 교 육 혁 신 센 터 소 장</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
